Owner request (#97, ADR-0013): the model selector moves from the header into the composer's action row (a quiet
"name ▾" button whose menu opens upward, without the search box); the conversation panel opens by default on desktop
(a new storage key resets an earlier collapsed state once, later choices persist); in RTL the sign-in brand panel sits
on the left and the form on the right (mirrored in LTR), with the theme switch in the outer corner; conversation titles
follow their own direction, because postcss-preset-env compiles `text-align: start` to `left`, which clipped the start
of Arabic titles. Builds on 0007 (AuthLayout.tsx).

